# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials — NOTHING in this block may ever be committed.
# See docs/CREDENTIALS.md. If one of these ever lands in a commit: rotate the
# key first, then clean history. Rotation is the fix; history rewriting is only
# cleanup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/firebase_options.dart
**/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.mobileprovision
**/service-account*.json

